 "description": "Monthly offense rates (per 100k population) and raw counts for national, state, or agency scope. Data comes from the FBI Crime Data Explorer summarized endpoint. Returns month-by-month data for the requested offense and date range. Use scope \"national\" or \"state\" for aggregate trends; scope \"agency\" for a single law enforcement agency by ORI code. Offense options: violent-crime, property-crime, robbery, burglary, larceny, motor-vehicle-theft, arson, aggravated-assault, rape, homicide.",
